//     unit = 16 bytes of K + 16 bytes of V (one uint4 each).
//     units_per_token = slot_bytes / 16.
//   * scalar fallback: unit = 1 byte of K + 1 byte of V.
//     units_per_token = slot_bytes. Handles any alignment.
//
